          "exampleId": "w:print#e-a0dd70b82e24c57d",
          "text": "The third technique is to try printing out a triple – spaced (三倍行距) copy to allow space for revision.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2022年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新高考全国Ⅱ卷）英语",
